# Leave this EMPTY, both locally and in production.
#
# Requests go to the same site at /api, and Vite (dev) or Vercel (production, see vercel.json)
# forwards them to the backend. That makes the login cookie "first-party", so login keeps working
# in Safari, on iPhones, in the installed app, and when third-party cookies are blocked.
#
# Only set this if you deploy WITHOUT the Vercel forwarding, e.g. https://musicstream-api.onrender.com/api
# (cross-site cookies then break in Safari and some privacy modes).
VITE_API_URL=
